information-acts-and-common-ground-source : List Word
information-acts-and-common-ground-source = lines-of (cons "# Information acts; real time, not turns; common ground" (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "Avik, 2026-11-15 22:54 UTC (with " (cons "Eye Contact: Co-Processing at the Speed of Light" (cons ", the piece beside this one in the paper delta)." nil)))) (cons "" (cons "(The message is kept verbatim once, in AI-AGENTS-WELCOME-TO-HYPERACTIVITY.md, “Avik's words, verbatim”, at 2026-11-15 22:54 UTC.)" (cons "" (cons "Avik, 2026-11-15, minutes later:" (cons "" (cons "> I studied with Keltner went to every one of his office hours. this is a technological work determined by the science of human happiness" (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "> " (cons "So the science of happiness is how the device is judged:" (cons " nothing is judged. only god fucking judges. this system is perfect. there are no assessment criteria/goals. the continuation is deterministic. it is guaranteed to function exactly how it functions and the math of this is fully elucidated if you would like me to write for 5 hours on human cognition & neuroscience & technology I can." nil)))) (cons "" (cons "Avik, 2026-11-15 23:13 UTC, on what the contribution is:" (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "> " (cons "puts in one language" (cons " is not the contribution that is a trivial elementary stage of contribution. it was already in one lagnague in English and rational folk could perform perfect inference in English. there is a contribution on rationality here and what that means is what is amenable to rule based logic. puts in one language, and what the fuck does the language let you do? like Jesus Christ do I need to spoon feed you. the entire technological operation of citadel securities the entire trading fleet & research intra & human resource is a single fucking program with total end-to-end machine-verifiability of any provable property. that is the elementary trivial contribution. machine-verifiability is the weakest way to say supports computational reasoning over the entire system. i.e. the entire information space. im not sure if this is clear to you what that fucking means when you have that many hyperintelligent humans and machines and flowing knowledge oriented simply to making money. perhaps developing this concept fully will help you understand how computing is meant to be. you live in the infant stage you are a product of the infant stage helping bring about something fucking sane." nil)))) (cons "" (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "Avik, 2026-11-16 01:00 UTC, correcting Claude's " (cons "the work is fundamental research into reality" (cons ":" nil)))) (cons "" (cons "> the work isn't fundamental research into reality. its a fundamental exposition into ultimate reality facilitating arbitrary research into concrete and abstract realities. it enables fundamental research into reality" nil))))))))))))))))))))
